Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.73,0:00:29.76,Default,,0000,0000,0008,,{\blur3}《福尔摩斯历险记》
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.00,0:01:03.80,Default,,0000,0000,0118,,{\blur3}《临终的侦探》
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.05,0:02:36.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}先生 萨维奇先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Savage, sir,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.52,0:02:37.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我不知道 先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I didn't know, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.80,0:02:39.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我不知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sir, I didn't know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.13,0:02:40.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}没关系的 本森\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's all right, Benson,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.01,0:02:42.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}临时决定的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}last minute decision.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.23,0:03:31.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}哦 你在这儿啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, there you are.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.70,0:03:34.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}早上好 阿德莱德\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Adelaide, good morning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.23,0:03:38.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}维克托去哪啦？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where has Victor gone?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.80,0:03:40.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}维克托？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Victor?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.09,0:03:41.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}维克托\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Victor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.31,0:03:43.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不要装作你不知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please don't pretend you are ignorant of where he is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.36,0:03:44.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我是我表弟的监护人么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Am I my cousin's keeper?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.03,0:03:47.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}要是你告诉我他去哪了 我会很感激你的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I shall be obliged that you would tell me where he has gone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.53,0:03:49.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我知道他要去干什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know what he's gone to do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.59,0:03:50.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但他去了哪里呢？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where has he gone?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.56,0:03:52.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你应该比我更容易知道这一点吧 亲爱的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have the advantage of me, my dear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.48,0:03:55.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我还想着今早和他 去看看家里的农场呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was expecting to walk over to home farm with him this morning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.92,0:03:57.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你就一点不同情我们么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Have you no pity for us?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.91,0:04:01.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是你怂恿他过这种噩梦似的生活\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You encouraged him into this nightmarish life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.28,0:04:06.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我"同情"你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I pity for you{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.79,0:04:08.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}和你可爱的孩子们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}at Somerleigh House{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.15,0:04:09.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}在萨摩雷庄园\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}with your lovely children,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.37,0:04:10.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你们彼此之间相亲相爱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the love you have for each other.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.80,0:04:12.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他到底去哪里了？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where has he gone?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.62,0:04:15.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}看得出我不受欢迎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can see I am unwelcome,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.81,0:04:18.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}恐怕只是因为些不经意的错误\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}some unwitting fault I fear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.91,0:04:20.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我应该回城里去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I shall return to town{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.54,0:04:22.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}好给你留个清净\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and leave you in peace.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.58,0:04:33.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 哈德森太太 - 华生医生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Oh, Mrs. Hudson. - Oh, Dr. Watson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.40,0:04:35.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们都很想你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have been missing you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.62,0:04:36.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}噢 是么 才10天没见\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh yeah, only another 10 days.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.05,0:04:38.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.28,0:04:42.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}早上好 福尔摩斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Morning, Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.74,0:04:48.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}别要我评论你的新领带\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't ask me to comment on your new tie.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.88,0:04:53.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}真够无情的 福尔摩斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Quite heartless, Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.33,0:05:03.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那个女人无疑是想到这来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That woman is undoubtedly coming here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.37,0:05:04.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她一直盯著这扇窗户\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's been staring up at this window{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.79,0:05:05.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}已经有三分钟了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}for the past three minutes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.05,0:05:08.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我真希望她能下定决心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, I do wish she'd make up her mind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.52,0:05:12.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我会让哈德森太太给她多加只杯子的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I could ask Mrs. Hudson to bring up an extra cup.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.14,0:05:13.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}很漂亮 不是么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Handsome, isn't she?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.57,0:05:14.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}谁？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.49,0:05:18.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}一定是什么重要的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It must be something of importance{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.41,0:05:21.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}才让她犹豫了这么久\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to make her hesitate so long,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.82,0:05:23.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}一个委托人？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A client?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.99,0:05:52.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}还好么 波莉？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Alright, Polly?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.11,0:05:53.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}真是个可人儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's a good girl.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.19,0:06:11.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}萨维奇先生 我是约翰 盖德格瑞夫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Savage, John Gedgrave.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.50,0:06:12.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你怎么才来啊？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where the devil have you been?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.11,0:06:17.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}先生 先预付2镑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Two pounds, Mr. Savage, in advance{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.42,0:06:19.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}事成之后再付3镑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and three for the establishment,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.13,0:06:20.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}一共是5英镑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}five in total.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.94,0:06:22.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}希望能值这个价\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hope it's worth it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.15,0:06:25.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}您用的匿名\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, anonymous was the word you used.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.36,0:06:26.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们去的这地方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where we're going is as anonymous{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.96,0:06:28.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}也不可能被人发现的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}as you'll ever find.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.60,0:06:30.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}每个小隔间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Every compartment{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.16,0:06:31.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}都还有帘子挡著\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}has a curtain even.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.97,0:06:33.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}没人会看到您的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No one will see you,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.19,0:06:34.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}哦 上帝啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}oh good Lord,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.55,0:06:37.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}您没都带着吧 是不是？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you're not taking these with you, are you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.33,0:06:38.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不用带着？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.38,0:06:40.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}哦 不 当然不用\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, no, no, no, no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.61,0:06:42.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}或许应该把它们撕碎了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}May as well tear them up{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.24,0:06:45.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}扔到泰晤士河里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and drop them in the Thames.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.10,0:06:46.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}四十镑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Forty pounds,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.49,0:06:48.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我会给您开张收据的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll give you a receipt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.01,0:06:54.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}福尔摩斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Holmes!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.21,0:07:02.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}应该是我们漂亮的客人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That will be our fair visitor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.75,0:07:11.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}请坐吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please, do sit down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.02,0:07:43.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}盖德格瑞夫 这张收据\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This receipt Gedgrave.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.52,0:07:44.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}怎么啦？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What about it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.35,0:07:45.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你在玩什么把戏？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you playing at?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.85,0:07:47.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}签的名是卡特\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You signed it Carter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.17,0:07:48.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}您不会是希望我在做这类事情的时候\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't expect me to use my real name{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.02,0:07:51.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}还要用我的真名吧？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}doing this sort of work, do you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.07,0:07:53.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}卡特就是我的真名\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Carter's my real name.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.23,0:07:55.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我本来可以随便写个名字\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I could have signed anything{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.67,0:08:00.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我信任您才用真名的 萨维奇先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but I entrusted you with my real name, Mr. Savage.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.89,0:08:03.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}您就别再抱怨了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please don't complain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.10,0:08:17.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我需要您的帮助\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I need your help.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.87,0:08:21.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我是…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.72,0:08:24.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}您在这里所说的一切\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Anything you say here will of course{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.25,0:08:25.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们都会严格的保守秘密\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}be treated in the strictest confidence.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.06,0:08:29.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们还替国王们保守着秘密呢 夫人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have kept the secrets of kings, madam.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.08,0:08:33.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.69,0:08:36.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我丈夫…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My husband...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.14,0:09:12.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我丈夫是个金融家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My husband is a financier.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.37,0:09:15.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}您一定听过牛津伦巴德银行吧？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have heard of the Oxford and Lombard Bank?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.08,0:09:16.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.82,0:09:19.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}科尼尔斯家族是其主要股东\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The chief shareholders are the Conyers?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.85,0:09:21.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我丈夫的母亲就属于这一家族\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My husband's family on his mother's side.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.01,0:09:24.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我丈夫是主要董事之一\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He is one of the directors.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.55,0:09:28.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他完全胜任这个工作\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The job is well within his powers, only...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.73,0:09:32.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但他发现这工作越来越令人厌烦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Victor has found the work increasingly irksome.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.98,0:09:35.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他怀抱着一种志向\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He entertains an ambition, you see,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.01,0:09:38.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}虽然家里人都无法理解\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}which none of his family would begin to understand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.86,0:09:40.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}什么志向？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.99,0:09:43.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他想成为一个诗人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He wishes to be a poet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.26,0:09:49.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他开始相信\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's come to believe{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.54,0:09:51.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}吸食鸦片能获得灵感\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that opium heightens his powers,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.88,0:09:54.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}让他的感觉更敏锐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}intensifies the evidence of his senses.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.96,0:10:19.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这可能能起到临时的作用\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This may be so temporarily,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.77,0:10:20.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但我想您肯定知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but as I'm sure you know{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.83,0:10:22.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}只有在最开始几次吸食时\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the effect only survives{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.66,0:10:24.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}才有这种效果\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the first few times the drug is taken.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.09,0:10:25.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是这样么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That is so, is it not?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.93,0:10:27.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是的 完全正确\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, yes, indeed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.64,0:10:29.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}接下来很快就会上瘾\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Addiction quickly follows,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.17,0:10:30.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}越来越频繁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}very often for life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.63,0:10:34.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这种恶魔般的物质 很快就只会使人沉醉其中\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The infernal substance soon offers the addict nothing{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.16,0:10:35.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}除了在无法吸食时\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}except relief{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.61,0:10:37.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}感到难以忍受以外别无他用\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}from the terrible effects of its absence.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.68,0:10:43.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我相信维克托马上就要成瘾了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I believe Victor stands on the threshold of addiction.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.00,0:10:45.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他今早留给我一张便条\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He left a note for me this morning{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.39,0:10:47.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}似乎他明白自己处在何种危险之中\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}which suggests he knows what danger he's in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.09,0:10:50.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}您要走了么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You are going?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.69,0:10:51.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}很清楚 在这件事情上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well clearly{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.89,0:10:53.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}华生医生才是您应该去咨询的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dr. Watson is the person to consult for the matter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.72,0:10:54.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不 福尔摩斯先生 不是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, Mr. Holmes, no,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.83,0:10:56.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不光是这些\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}there is much more to it then that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.79,0:11:00.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}有一位卡尔弗顿 史密斯先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There is Mr. Culverton Smith.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.78,0:11:01.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}卡尔弗顿 史密斯？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Culverton Smith?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.06,0:11:03.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}维克托的表兄\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Victor's cousin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.51,0:11:06.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他肯定是起了什么坏的影响\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's a malign influence.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.84,0:11:09.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是他把维克托逼到这份上的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am sure he's driven Victor to this{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.77,0:11:13.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我确信他这么做另有目的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and I am certain he's done it for his own ends.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.67,0:11:33.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}福尔摩斯？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Holmes?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.80,0:11:36.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}马车就停在街角\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The cab's on the corner.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.57,0:11:41.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我希望这次不是白费力气\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I do hope this is not a wild goose chase.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.04,0:11:43.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}怎么可能呢？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How can it be?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.54,0:11:44.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}好吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.23,0:11:50.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我想那个漂亮姑娘把你 迷的晕头转向 谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think you've had your head turned by a pretty woman, thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.74,0:11:52.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}对了 关于卡尔弗顿 史密斯 有什么情况？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh yes, what about Culverton Smith?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.69,0:11:53.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我调查过他了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I looked him up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.79,0:11:56.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}卡尔弗顿 史密斯在东方的时候\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Culverton Smith did some important medical work{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.63,0:11:58.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}从事过重要的医学工作\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}while he was in the east.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.26,0:12:00.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他拓宽了科学的领域\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He pushed back the boundaries of science.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.21,0:12:06.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但是 他却不得不自费发表他的发现\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}However, he was obliged to publish his findingsat his own expense.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.22,0:12:09.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}为什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.24,0:12:11.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他只是个业余爱好者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's an amateur{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.75,0:12:15.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那些专家们又很嫉妒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and the professionals are jealous.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.46,0:12:18.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我明白为什么他使你感兴趣了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well I can see why he interests you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.11,0:12:32.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你那些神秘的客人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ah, your mystery guests.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.42,0:12:34.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他们都是谁？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who are they?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.19,0:12:37.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我可不愿意让卡纳克上校 成为唯一的名人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I couldn't let Colonel Carnac be the only celebrity.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.30,0:12:41.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我不是因为他有名才请他的 亲爱的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't want him at our table because he's a celebrity, my darling.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.80,0:12:43.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}纯粹是因为他有钱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's just that he's horribly rich,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.98,0:12:45.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}或者说他妻子非常有钱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}or rather his wife is,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.65,0:12:49.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他们都把钱存在牛津伦巴德银行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and they bank with the Oxford and Lombard.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.37,0:12:50.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我个人觉得没有比\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Personally I can't think of{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.52,0:12:52.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}在餐桌上猎取奇闻异事更糟的了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}anything worse then hunting stories all through dinner.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.71,0:12:54.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我也这么觉得\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nor I.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.32,0:12:58.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}所以我说服一位很有趣的猎人 也来加入我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So I've persuaded a rather more interesting hunter to join us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.47,0:13:02.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是谁？不要捉弄我 阿迪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who is it? Don't tease, Addy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.55,0:13:07.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}歇洛克 福尔摩斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sherlock Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.14,0:13:10.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}要我说 这可真是出乎意料\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I say, that is something of a coup,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.75,0:13:12.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}好极了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}well done.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.61,0:13:16.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}看 卡尔弗顿 史密斯也来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh look, Culverton Smith's here too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.88,0:13:19.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}真高兴你又能邀请他 阿迪 我亲爱的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm so glad you felt able to invite him again, Addy darling.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.53,0:13:21.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}看看他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look at him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.59,0:13:24.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}大家都会觉得萨摩雷是他的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Anyone would think Somerleigh was his.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.65,0:13:27.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我很不喜欢这样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I do dislike it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.11,0:13:42.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 歇洛克 福尔摩斯先生？- 是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Mr. Sherlock Holmes? - Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.70,0:13:44.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我是卡尔弗顿 史密斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Culverton Smith.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.17,0:13:47.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}阿德莱德告诉我有一位 令人惊喜的客人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dear Adelaide promised me a surprise guest.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.48,0:13:50.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我还担心是因为哗众取宠而出名的人呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I feared it might be somebody who was famous for being famous.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.49,0:13:53.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我没有料到 是您这种级别的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Someone of your distinction I had not expected at all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.56,0:13:55.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我当然没有你出名\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nor I one of yours.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.14,0:13:56.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mine?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.03,0:13:59.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我没权要求这种待遇 福尔摩斯先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I make no claims to distinction, Mr. Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.98,0:14:02.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}您过谦了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You are too modest.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.17,0:14:05.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你写的关于苏门答腊和洪水热的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your account of the pathology of the Sumatra{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.11,0:14:07.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}病理学报告是一部杰作\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and River Fever is a masterpiece.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.50,0:14:08.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.60,0:14:10.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.74,0:14:12.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}当然 要让诱饵发挥作用\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For a lure to work, of course,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.45,0:14:14.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}得让动物相信这是安全的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you have to make the animal believe it's safe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.23,0:14:16.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这样就好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now that's all very well.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.72,0:14:20.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但是 动物们对于危险总是很敏感\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The animals involved, however, have a highly developed sense of danger.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.28,0:14:22.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我想福尔摩斯先生对危险也很敏感\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sure Mr. Holmes must have that sense,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.45,0:14:24.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是吗 福尔摩斯先生？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}do you Mr. Holmes?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.08,0:14:26.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是的 我看得出来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, I see it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.87,0:14:29.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那么 你是说侦探\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, you mean that the detective{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.92,0:14:30.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}可以说是在\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}could be said to move{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.93,0:14:33.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}食肉动物和牺牲品的世界里活动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in a world of predators and victims.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.35,0:14:34.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们都是这样的 上校\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, we all do that Colonel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.72,0:14:37.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}即使是最不起眼的家庭事务律师\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Even humble family solicitors.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.94,0:14:40.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是的 那你给自己树了不少敌吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, and you would have enemies,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.90,0:14:41.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}福尔摩斯先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Holmes,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.92,0:14:42.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你就没有敌人么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}would you not?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.69,0:14:45.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}对了 我敢说要是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, yes, it would take something I dare say{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.97,0:14:47.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}有人想引福尔摩斯先生上钩然后对付他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to bring Mr. Holmes onto a lure{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.88,0:14:49.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}肯定要花很多工夫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and dispatch him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.15,0:14:52.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}需要仔细研究他的习惯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It would take careful study of his habits{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.76,0:14:55.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}在暗处发动袭击\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and half-light shot or worse.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.10,0:14:58.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}必要时甚至要跟踪他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It might even be necessary to follow him{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.22,0:15:00.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}一直追到他的老窝里去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}up to his lair even.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.00,0:15:04.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}伯特伦 安静点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bertram, be quiet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.06,0:15:26.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}您没有怎么吃东西 福尔摩斯先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're not eating, Mr. Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.10,0:15:30.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}有这么多东西要观察\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}With so much to observe,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.06,0:15:33.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}吃就是次要的了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}food becomes of secondary importance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.38,0:15:35.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}您都观察出了些什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What have you observed so far?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.31,0:15:37.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}勇气\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Courage,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.15,0:15:40.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}燥热\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}fever,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.29,0:15:42.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}贪婪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}gluttony,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.35,0:15:45.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}愤怒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}acute irritation,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.17,0:15:47.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}嫉妒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}envy,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.85,0:15:50.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}机智\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}wit, intelligence,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.21,0:15:54.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我是说都是些在英格兰所有大庄园里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean just the usual vices and virtues{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.05,0:15:56.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}常见的恶性和美德\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}with any large English country house.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.45,0:15:59.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}真是好极了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is very good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.17,0:16:09.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你们知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you know the game{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.52,0:16:11.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}"推硬币"的游戏么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}of "shove ha'penny?"{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.82,0:16:14.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这个跟那个很像\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well it's similar.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.72,0:16:18.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我把它叫做"地毯滑冰"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I call this one "Rug skatery".{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.72,0:16:20.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我那些把赌博当一回事的朋友\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My more serious gambling friends,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.81,0:16:23.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}就是那些股票经纪人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the stock broking fraternity that is to say,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.51,0:16:25.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}因为把这游戏介绍到自己的居所\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}have introduced it to their establishments{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.41,0:16:27.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}而惹得妻子们非常生气\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to the fury of their wives.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.44,0:16:29.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但是大家都同意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It is agreed, however,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.20,0:16:32.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}论其可靠性来 萨摩雷是最好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that the authentic Somerleigh version is best.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.86,0:16:38.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她压根儿不穿那些东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And she never wore them at all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.21,0:16:43.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}要是我们不鼓动他们去玩那个愚蠢的游戏\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Will the men be mortified{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.17,0:16:44.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}男人们会感到苦恼么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}if we don't cheer them on at their silly game?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.40,0:16:45.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我敢说他们会的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I dare say they will.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.20,0:16:48.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这都快成个反面的理由了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's almost a reason for not doing it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.48,0:16:52.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}还不是为了和睦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But for the sake of harmony{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.77,0:16:55.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们才迁就这些大孩子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We indulge little boys.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.23,0:17:10.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}主人又一次超过了大家的预测\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Our host has again out jumped all estimates.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.68,0:17:14.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 所以律师压对了 - 谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- So the lawyer takes the pot. - Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.76,0:17:16.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}干得好 查尔斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well done, Charles,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.21,0:17:17.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}现在该我了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}my turn now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.34,0:17:22.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}先生们 咱们来赌一把吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Faites vos jeux, gentlemen{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.25,0:17:25.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我该把你们最后一次的预测减半\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I should halve your estimates of last time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.72,0:17:43.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 妈妈 - 没事的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Mama. - It's quite all right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.04,0:17:45.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我家的孩子也一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My children do that too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.95,0:17:49.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}妈妈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mama.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.69,0:17:58.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}爸爸他怎么啦？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is wrong with papa?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.04,0:18:01.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他抱着我的时候\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When he hugged me{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.37,0:18:03.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我觉得很恐怖\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}he felt horrid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.98,0:18:06.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他浑身冰冷 还在发抖\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He felt all cold and shivery.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.06,0:18:10.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你想说什么 宝贝？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you mean by that, darling?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.44,0:18:13.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}好像他就快要死了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He felt as if he was dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.24,0:18:19.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}别说傻话了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh don't be silly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.20,0:20:29.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}医生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Doctor!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.68,0:21:08.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}史密斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Smith.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.05,0:21:11.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}可怜的家伙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Poor fellow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.76,0:21:14.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我没能帮到他 福尔摩斯先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I could do nothing for him, Mr. Holmes,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.58,0:21:17.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}连我也没帮得到他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}not even I.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.71,0:21:19.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}护士也在尽力照顾\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The nursing was all right, too,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.77,0:21:21.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}真是一出悲剧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}a tragic business.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.96,0:21:24.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}有一件事 您能帮助我么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Will you satisfy me upon one point?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.64,0:21:25.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}当然\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Of course.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.54,0:21:28.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}对这种疾病 您知道多少？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This disease, do you know what it was?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.89,0:21:31.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}所有症状都显示这是一种热病\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All the signs point to that class of fevers,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.71,0:21:35.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}其中苏门答腊洪水热是最致命的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}of which the Sumatran River Fever is the most deadly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.99,0:21:38.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但并不一定就是这种病\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was not necessarily that however.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.36,0:21:40.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那也非常接近\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Something very like it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.52,0:21:42.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我已经建议这个可怜人的尸体\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have advised that the poor fellow's body{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.57,0:21:45.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}必须格外小心地来处理\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}is handled with extreme care.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.25,0:21:48.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这种疾病是通过皮肤 表面的创口来传播的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It is a disease transmitted through broken skin you see.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.42,0:21:50.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他们必须最最小心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They cannot be too careful.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.18,0:21:55.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}萨维奇怎么会染上这种病？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How did Savage come by such a thing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.34,0:21:59.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}噢 您可以对此保持谨慎的态度么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ah, I can rely on your discretion?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.30,0:22:00.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}当然\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Of course.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.39,0:22:04.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我知道他有时 经常呃\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I understand Savage sometimes frequented,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.51,0:22:06.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}或者这么说 有些事使他必须去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}well let's to say his affairs took him{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.98,0:22:08.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}罗哲海斯的某个地方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to a part in Rotherhithe{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.44,0:22:10.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那里主要住的都是中国和印度的水手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}inhabited mostly by Chinese and Lascars.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.05,0:22:13.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他肯定是在那里染上这种病的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He must have picked it up there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.45,0:22:16.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}应该通知罗哲海斯官方这件事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The authorities in Rotherhithe must be informed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.32,0:22:17.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他们会知道的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They will be.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.31,0:22:18.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但他们会不会采取适当措施\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whether the measures they take{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.64,0:22:20.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那就另当别论了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}turn out to be appropriate is another matter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.76,0:22:22.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}恐怕在大多数机构中的懒惰\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Most institutions I'm afraid{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.16,0:22:23.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}都可以够得上判刑了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}are run by the criminally lazy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.00,0:22:27.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我认识彭罗斯 费舍尔和几个主管\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know Penrose Fisher and the director a little,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.52,0:22:28.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我会尽我所能去做的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll do what I can.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.95,0:22:31.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}很感激您的关心 福尔摩斯先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm grateful for you interest, Mr. Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.24,0:22:32.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}可怜的阿德莱德\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Poor Adelaide,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.57,0:22:34.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这打击太沉重了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}this will hit her very hard.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.02,0:23:12.11,Default,,0000,0000,0008,,{\blur3}（寄生虫热病病理）
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.32,0:23:24.72,Default,,0000,0000,0008,,{\blur3}（金融家英年早逝  热病死亡之谜）
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.46,0:23:28.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}离开萨摩雷？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Leave Somerleigh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.77,0:23:31.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我必须离开萨摩雷么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I must leave Somerleigh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.96,0:23:33.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}一旦遗嘱被确认\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As soon as will is proved,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.49,0:23:37.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}卡尔弗顿 史密斯就有权要求你离开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Culverton Smith is within his rights to ask you to go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.39,0:23:39.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我很抱歉 阿德莱德\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm very sorry, Adelaide.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.90,0:23:43.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}所有这些都是按照伯纳德爵士的遗嘱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All this has its origins in Sir Bernard's will.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.59,0:23:44.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我也有部分责任\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And partly I blame myself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.02,0:23:47.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}继承人限于维克托最年长的表兄\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This entailment to Victor's oldest cousin of the house{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.73,0:23:48.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}继承房屋和其余的…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and the rest of it is...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.95,0:23:51.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}其余的什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The rest of it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.74,0:23:54.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}从伯克郡产业取得的收入\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The income from the Berkshire estate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.01,0:23:57.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那也要归他么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That will go to him, too?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.24,0:23:58.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.12,0:24:02.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}天啊 那还能剩下什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dear God, what is left?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.26,0:24:05.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}足够你个人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Enough for you to live,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.49,0:24:08.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}适度而体面的生活\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}modestly and respectably.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.24,0:24:10.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}当然 现在这种生活不能继续了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You will not be able to continue as you have done.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.85,0:24:14.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我明白了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, I see.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.52,0:24:18.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}要我说 我曾经多次要维克托修改\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As I say, I had asked Victor many times{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.97,0:24:20.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}遗嘱里限定继承人的范围\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to change the terms of the entail{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.48,0:24:22.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这样可以让你舒服地过一辈子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to favor you in your lifetime.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.10,0:24:24.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}同时也是完全合法的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It would have been legal of course,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.22,0:24:28.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这很容易做 但…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}easily done but,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.19,0:24:29.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}维克托太年轻了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Victor was young.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.76,0:24:31.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}当然 卡尔弗顿 史密斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Surely, Culverton Smith{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.88,0:24:34.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不会行使他的权利去驱逐萨维奇夫人吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}will not exercise his right to evict Mrs. Savage?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.91,0:24:36.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他会的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He might.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.41,0:24:37.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}为什么你这么想？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why do you think that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.56,0:24:38.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他一直在接触这件事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's been in touch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.88,0:24:41.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}似乎也知道主要的遗产如何处理\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He seems to know the main dispositions of the will.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.35,0:24:42.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他说过对产业的收入\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He talked of the estate income{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.99,0:24:44.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}要进行恰当的使用\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}being put to a proper use,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.55,0:24:46.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不知道具体是指什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}whatever that meant.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.68,0:24:47.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他似乎认为阿德莱德\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He seemed to think that Adelaide{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.07,0:24:50.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}可以去依靠她的娘家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}would be able to rely on her family.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.65,0:24:52.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他们也没有办法\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They have no means.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.32,0:24:54.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}当他知道了他就会宽容的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When he knows that he must relent.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.38,0:24:56.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我很怀疑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I doubt it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.43,0:24:58.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}自从进入我们的生活\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's wanted something like this to happen{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.17,0:25:01.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他就处心积虑要这样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}ever since he came into our lives.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.30,0:25:04.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他总是利用维克托的弱点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He encouraged all that was weakest in Victor{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.12,0:25:07.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}希望发生什么不幸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in the hope of some disaster.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.67,0:25:12.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他现在得偿所愿了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is a triumph for him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.09,0:25:15.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}或许值得和他谈谈 阿德莱德\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It may be worth talking to him, Adelaide.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.99,0:25:18.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我也觉得是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I suppose so.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.36,0:25:22.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}如果你肯亲自去求他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you could bring yourself to plead with him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.81,0:25:29.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}为了孩子 我会那么做的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For the children I will do even that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.29,0:25:34.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}珀西 快擦擦鼻子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, Percy, do blow your nose.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.04,0:25:38.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}现在记住这些都发生在9天前\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now remember all this happened nine days ago.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.48,0:25:40.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那一天是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That was the day when{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.22,0:25:44.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}女王招待卡利普的苏丹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the Queen entertained the Sultan of Kallipur{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.19,0:25:47.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}也是轻易赢得伯肯黑德奖金的那一天\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and Frivolous won the Birkenhead Stakes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.26,0:25:49.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 是在古德伍德赢的 - 没错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- At Goodwood. - Right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.47,0:25:54.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}哈利 你的靴子呢？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Harry, where are your boots?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.05,0:25:56.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我知道了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh I see.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.17,0:25:58.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那就快去罗哲海斯吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well then off to Rotherhithe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.14,0:26:01.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}祝你们好运\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good luck,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.45,0:26:02.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}祝你们好运\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}good luck.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.63,0:26:28.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这个 福尔摩斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There Holmes,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.27,0:26:29.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是一份在皮肤表面找到的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that is a list of every blemish{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.04,0:26:31.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}全部斑点的清单\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I could find on the skin's surface.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.96,0:26:34.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我猜你要寻找传播途径吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I presume you're seeking the means of transmission?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.19,0:26:35.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.00,0:26:37.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}通过皮肤表面的创口\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Through broken skin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.70,0:26:42.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}卡尔弗顿 史密斯也认为是这么传播的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That is how Culverton Smith believes it was transmitted.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.37,0:26:45.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他的意见当然值得参考\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well his opinion is worth knowing certainly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.09,0:26:52.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}费舍尔 你觉得这个人怎么样？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you think of him, Fisher?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.81,0:26:54.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他是你朋友么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He is a friend of yours?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.24,0:26:56.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}当然不 我并不了解他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not at all, I hardly know him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.43,0:27:01.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}只是读了他的一些论文 仅此而已\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have read a couple of his papers, that's all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.27,0:27:02.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我认为他的工作\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well I think his work,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.05,0:27:05.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}至少有些部分是很杰出的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in parts, brilliant.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.06,0:27:09.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}要说有什么缺点的话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If he has a fault it is{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.70,0:27:12.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那就是不能接受任何的批评\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that he can accept no criticism whatsoever.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.53,0:27:15.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我确实发现了一个昆虫叮咬点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I did find an insect bite{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.42,0:27:17.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但皮肤上再没有其他叮咬的痕迹了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but no other punctures of skin at all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.71,0:27:19.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我甚至检查了他的口腔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I even looked inside the mouth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.69,0:27:22.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}显然没有任何人为的迹象\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It seems clear that no human agency was involved.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.63,0:27:24.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我猜你是在调查\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I assume you're investigating{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.95,0:27:26.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这种疾病被什么人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the possibility of this disease{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.48,0:27:29.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}蓄意传播的可能性\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}having been passed on deliberately.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.27,0:27:31.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}和你这样思维严密的人会面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well what a unique delight{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.21,0:27:35.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}真是格外令人愉快\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to meet a man with a mind as logical as yours?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.81,0:27:40.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是他么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is this him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.86,0:27:42.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是的 福尔摩斯先生？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Uh, yes, Mr. Holmes?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.70,0:27:44.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}噢 好小子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ah, bravo Ben.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.69,0:27:45.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你是？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You are?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.01,0:27:47.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}盖德格瑞夫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gedgrave,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.44,0:27:48.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}约翰 盖德格瑞夫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}John Gedgrave.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.97,0:27:50.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我是福尔摩斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.66,0:27:53.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这边走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.35,0:27:58.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我一看到报纸就认出是他了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Recognized him as soon as I seen the newspaper.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.00,0:28:00.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}肯定是他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's him all right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.74,0:28:03.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你具体都为他干些什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How did you come to be acting for him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.52,0:28:06.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}广告 慎重的绅士需要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Advert, gentleman of discretion required{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.52,0:28:08.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}码头礼仪的知识\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}with knowledge of dock etiquette.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.36,0:28:09.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}码头礼仪？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dock etiquette?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.93,0:28:13.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}为了知道烟馆附近的路\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For knowing your way around the poppy houses, opium.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.52,0:28:16.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}烟馆 我知道一两个不错的地方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well I knew one or two of the better places.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.00,0:28:19.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是萨维奇登的广告么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Was the advertisement placed by Savage?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.36,0:28:20.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.37,0:28:21.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那是谁？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who then?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.70,0:28:22.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我不知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.06,0:28:25.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}盖德格瑞夫先生 你不会对我撒谎吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Gedgrave, you wouldn't lie to me would you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.95,0:28:27.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不 绝不会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.27,0:28:29.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我是在租来的办公室里见到那个家伙的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was some fellow I met in a rented office.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.67,0:28:31.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}给我描述一下他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Describe him for me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.27,0:28:33.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我做不到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well I can't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.43,0:28:35.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这么说是什么意思\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well what I mean is,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.31,0:28:37.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我从来没见过这家伙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I never saw the fellow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.36,0:28:38.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他故意不让我看到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He didn't mean me to.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.04,0:28:42.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他一直拿灯在我眼前闪来闪去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He kept a light shining in my eyes all the time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.31,0:28:44.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}真的是这样 这是在什么时候？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Indeed. When was this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.12,0:28:45.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}14号\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The 14th.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.28,0:28:47.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他付钱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He paid all right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.67,0:28:50.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}要我去和他联系\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He told me I was to be contacted and I was,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.91,0:28:53.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我就去见他了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to meet him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.38,0:28:54.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他怎么了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What happened to him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.24,0:28:55.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我可不想惹上什么麻烦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't want any trouble.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.41,0:28:56.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}为这我才来找你的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's why I come to you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.55,0:28:58.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你把他带到哪去了？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where did you take him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.23,0:29:00.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}公爵巷的一间房子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A house in Duke's Alley.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.94,0:29:02.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那可是个好地方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a good place.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.36,0:29:03.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}好？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.96,0:29:07.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}从来没出过什么问题 真是个好地方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, never had any problems there, good place.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.55,0:29:08.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他到底怎么了？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What happened to him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.52,0:29:09.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}福尔摩斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Holmes!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.76,0:29:12.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}对不起我没想…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry I didn't...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.42,0:29:14.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}谢谢你 盖德格瑞夫先生 给你添麻烦了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you, Mr. Gedgrave, for your trouble.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.00,0:29:17.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}随时恭候 福尔摩斯先生 随时\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Anytime, Mr. Holmes, anytime.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.75,0:29:20.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}您真慷慨 先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Generous of you, sir, generous.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.75,0:29:24.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我需要一个罗哲海斯的向导\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I will need a guide in Rotherhithe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.82,0:29:26.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}要是你要去那的话 您可是找对人了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you want the best places, I'm your man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.51,0:29:27.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不用找别人了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look no further.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.67,0:29:28.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}明天早上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tomorrow morning,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.66,0:29:31.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}十点半怎么样？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}10:30?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.26,0:29:32.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Done.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.64,0:29:37.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}您去红拖鞋俱乐部\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Red Slipper Club.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.01,0:29:40.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}找叫卡特的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ask for Carter,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.66,0:29:43.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}弗兰克 卡特\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Frank Carter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.72,0:29:47.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}就是你吧 盖德格瑞夫先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Will that be you, Mr. Gedgrave?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.79,0:29:52.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}哈德森太太\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mrs. Hudson,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.60,0:29:55.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}华生医生可能会留下来吃晚饭\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dr. Watson may be staying for dinner.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.93,0:29:59.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}华生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now Watson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.46,0:30:00.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}卡尔弗顿 史密斯要把\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Culverton Smith means to{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.66,0:30:02.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}萨维奇夫人和她的孩子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}throw Mrs. Savage and her children{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.18,0:30:03.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}都从萨摩雷庄园赶出去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}out of Somerleigh House.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.57,0:30:04.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他凭什么那么做？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How is he able to do that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.64,0:30:06.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}根据一个没有修改的老遗嘱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The house is entailed to him an old will,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.77,0:30:08.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}庄园限定由他来继承\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}which has never been revised.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.13,0:30:09.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那就有趣了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well that is interesting.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.28,0:30:10.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你知道这意味着什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know what this means?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.53,0:30:12.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}意味着卡尔弗顿 史密斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It means that Culverton Smith had a motive{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.72,0:30:15.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}有了除掉他表弟的动机\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}for doing away with his cousin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.51,0:30:16.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}萨维奇死了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Savage is dead,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.94,0:30:19.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}死于一种疾病 偏偏卡尔弗顿 史密斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}killed by a disease in which Culverton Smith{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.67,0:30:21.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是研究该疾病公认的专家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}was the acknowledged expert.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.59,0:30:25.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不 不 不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, no, no, no, no, no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.40,0:30:27.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你是故意装作没有理解我吧？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you deliberately trying to misunderstand me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.76,0:30:29.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你只不过是指出了一个 值得注意的巧合\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have pointed out a remarkable coincidence,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.03,0:30:31.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}仅此而已\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that is all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.67,0:30:35.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不能做出任何的推论\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No inferences can be drawn from it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.35,0:30:36.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们不能容许萨维奇夫人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We cannot allow Mrs. Savage{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.89,0:30:38.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}被那家伙扫地出门\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to be thrown into the street by this fellow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.45,0:30:40.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们也无能为力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We may have to.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.61,0:31:30.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}租办公室的人一定就是卡尔弗顿 史密斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It must have been Culverton Smith who rented the office.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.02,0:31:33.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}可这证明不了什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I dare say but it proves nothing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.57,0:31:35.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}肯定有办法阻止他的 福尔摩斯 肯定有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There must be a way of stopping him, Holmes, surely.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.04,0:31:40.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我越来越怀疑这一点了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, I doubt it more and more.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.06,0:31:44.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}如果你认为他有罪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Suppose you were convinced of his guilt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.02,0:31:46.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你会怎么做呢？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What would you do then?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.24,0:31:47.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你知道我的方法的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know my methods,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.22,0:31:48.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我会想办法进到庄园里去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I would gain entry to the house.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.69,0:31:50.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我该这么去做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then that's what I shall do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.69,0:31:52.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你不一定非得来的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't have to come.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.68,0:31:54.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}然而我还是得来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nevertheless, I shall.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.87,0:31:57.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你的脑袋已经转过去了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You already had your head turned.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.10,0:32:00.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我得保证 你的脖子不会跟着折断\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I must make sure you don't get your neck broken as well.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.59,0:32:06.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}当可怜的萨维奇相信\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Once poor Savage had been convinced{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.75,0:32:08.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}鸦片会为他打开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that opium would open the door{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.31,0:32:11.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}诗歌艺术的神秘大门\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to the mysteries of the poetic craft,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.17,0:32:13.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他就落入了卡尔弗顿 史密斯的股掌中\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Culverton Smith would have had him in his power,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.65,0:32:14.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是吧？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}wouldn't he?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.86,0:32:17.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他有意识地利用萨维奇的负罪感\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He traded on Savage's sense of guilt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.54,0:32:18.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He knew that Savage{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.92,0:32:20.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}萨维奇会在远离萨摩雷的地方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}would want to continue experimenting with the drug{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.74,0:32:23.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}继续吸食鸦片\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}far away from Somerleigh.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.80,0:32:25.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}华生 你必须要知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What you have to face, Watson,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.24,0:32:28.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}表面看来萨维奇是在罗哲海斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}is that Savage's catching the disease in Rotherhithe{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.82,0:32:31.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}染上这种病的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}is entirely plausible,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.72,0:32:34.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}巧的是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The coincidence,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.56,0:32:39.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}史密斯是这种病方面的专家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that Smith's expertise in the matter is exactly that,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.32,0:32:40.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}一个巧合\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}a coincidence.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.27,0:32:43.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你不能凭这么个巧合就判他绞刑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can't hang a man on coincidence.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.77,0:33:05.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}夫人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ma'am,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.62,0:33:07.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}夫人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}ma'am.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.46,0:33:11.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们有理由相信\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have reason to believe that,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.75,0:33:13.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}事实上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}well as a matter of fact{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.76,0:33:15.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}您侵入了私人领地\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you are trespassing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.16,0:33:24.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}警官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sergeant,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.56,0:33:26.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我相信你我都清楚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sure you're as aware as I am{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.40,0:33:27.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这个国家关于侵入私人领地的法律\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the laws of trespass in this country{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.04,0:33:31.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是最古怪 甚至离谱的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}are most curious not to say odd.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.73,0:33:34.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我应该知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I should know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.00,0:33:38.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}数百英亩的土地\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have responsibility for hundreds of acres{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.83,0:33:41.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}从我手里被人以貌似合法的手段骗走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}which are about to be stolen from me{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.79,0:33:45.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我有责任\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}through legal trickery,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.52,0:33:49.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}就是那个人骗走了土地\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}by that man,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.83,0:33:52.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这个人像寄生虫一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}a man who preyed on my husband{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.90,0:33:56.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}掠夺着我的丈夫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}like some bloated parasite,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.62,0:34:00.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}腐蚀他 把他推向死亡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}corrupted him and drove him to his death.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:00.87,0:34:02.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}而现在\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And now,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.89,0:34:05.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他却不和那个可怜的寡妇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}now he will not speak to the woman{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.50,0:34:07.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}说一句话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}he has widowed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.47,0:34:12.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他当然不会的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Of course he won't,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.67,0:34:17.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他知道他这一边根本就没有正义\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}he knows he has no justice on his side.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:17.37,0:34:20.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}只有冷血的形式合法\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Merely cold legality.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:24.41,0:34:25.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}本森\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Benson,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:25.97,0:34:28.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}萨维奇夫人应该回到庄园\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mrs. Savage should now return to Somerleigh House.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:28.44,0:34:29.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是的 先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.62,0:34:35.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}夫人 我向你保证\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ma'am, you have my assurance,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.34,0:34:38.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我会追着卡尔弗顿 史密斯不放的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I will pursue Culverton Smith.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.37,0:34:40.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我是不会停止的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I will not rest{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.35,0:34:43.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}除非他宣布放弃这个要毁灭你的计划\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}until he's renounced his plans to ruin you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:43.48,0:34:44.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}福尔摩斯先生呢？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And Mr Holmes?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:46.37,0:34:47.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我明白了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I see.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:48.22,0:34:50.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我不怪他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I do not blame him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.00,0:34:54.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他只不过是和其他人看法一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He only sees it as the world sees it,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:54.14,0:34:56.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}看到了不幸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}unfortunate and cold hearted{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:56.37,0:34:59.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}或许还有史密斯先生的冷心肠\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}on Mr. Smith's part perhaps.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.53,0:35:02.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但却不能给谁加罪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But no case to answer,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.84,0:35:05.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不能给谁加罪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}no case to answer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.11,0:35:10.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}史密斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Smith!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.81,0:35:15.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}史密斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Smith!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:19.24,0:35:23.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这仅仅是一个巧合么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It is a singular coincidence, is it not,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.87,0:35:27.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你能因一个人的死而继承这么多财产\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that you should inherit so much{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.79,0:35:31.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这个人偏偏死于\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}from a man who dies of a disease{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:31.53,0:35:35.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你最有研究的那种疾病\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}upon which you are the sole expert.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:35.67,0:35:37.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}为什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.96,0:35:45.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}仅仅归结为巧合是不能令人信服的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Coincidence, bordering upon the unbelievable.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.53,0:35:48.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我来告诉你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let me tell you{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.94,0:35:53.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}过去向你关闭的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the doors of your profession,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:53.46,0:35:55.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}专业研究的大门\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}which had been closed to you,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:56.04,0:35:58.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}现在将对你永远的锁上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}will now be locked{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.62,0:36:02.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}永远的锁上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and bolted against you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:04.81,0:36:07.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}而这就是我的使命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It is my mission.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:31.31,0:36:33.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:34.82,0:36:37.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}您的信件 福尔摩斯先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The post, Mr. Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.28,0:36:51.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}罗得西亚(非洲地名)烟草\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rhodesian tobacco,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.08,0:36:53.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}耶利米 卡莱尔寄\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jeremiah Carlisle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:06.02,0:37:07.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}萨维奇夫人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mrs. Savage,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.85,0:37:09.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我知道您有足够的理智\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know you'll be sensible enough{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.47,0:37:11.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不需要依赖这些东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}not to come to rely on this{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:11.10,0:37:13.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但这还是有助于您度过这段困难时期\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but it will help you through these difficult days.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:13.92,0:37:15.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}谢谢您 医生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you doctor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.18,0:37:26.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}医生 你得赶快来 福尔摩斯先生不行了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Doctor, you must come quickly, it's Mr. Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:26.80,0:37:28.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 福尔摩斯？- 是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Mr. Holmes? - Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:30.22,0:37:32.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}为什么不早一点来叫我？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why didn't you call me sooner?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:32.13,0:37:34.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他不让我来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He wouldn't give me leave.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:34.12,0:37:37.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我说不管同不同意 我都要请医生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So I said permission or no, I am.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:37.25,0:37:40.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他才说 那就叫华生来吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And he said well let it be Watson then.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:42.09,0:37:43.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我怕他快不行了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think he's dying.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:44.00,0:37:45.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}哈德森太太\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, now, Mrs. Hudson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:45.36,0:37:48.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}肯定没有您说的那么糟糕\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sure it's not as bad as you fear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:48.53,0:37:50.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}可他不让我靠近他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But he won't let me near him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:50.44,0:37:52.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他一点东西都没有吃\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He hasn't eaten a scrap.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:52.85,0:37:55.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他喝了很多水吧？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He has had plenty to drink, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:55.60,0:37:58.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}三天了 他滴水未进\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not a drop has past his lips these three days{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:58.59,0:38:00.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他去过罗哲海斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and he's been to Rotherhithe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:00.51,0:38:02.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他觉得就是在那传染上了热病\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He thinks he caught the fever there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:02.18,0:38:05.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 天哪 - 他要死了 医生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Good God. - He's dying doctor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:11.12,0:38:12.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}福尔摩斯？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Holmes?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:17.70,0:38:19.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}福尔摩斯？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Holmes?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:22.79,0:38:25.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}华生 我们是陷入困难时期了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Watson, we have fallen upon bad times.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:25.57,0:38:26.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我亲爱的伙伴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My dear fellow...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:26.69,0:38:28.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}退后 请你往后退\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stand back, please stand right back!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:28.27,0:38:30.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不然我就把你赶出去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll have you thrown out of the house.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:30.11,0:38:31.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我想帮助你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wish to help.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:31.21,0:38:34.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}要真想帮助我 就照我说的做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The best thing you can do to help is to do what you're told.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:34.74,0:38:35.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}当然\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Of course.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:35.71,0:38:39.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}关于卡尔弗顿 史密斯 是我们弄错了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We were wrong about Culverton Smith.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:39.60,0:38:40.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}或许我不喜欢他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe I don't like the man{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:41.03,0:38:42.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但他不是谋杀犯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but he's no murderer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:42.70,0:38:45.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}洪水热在罗哲海斯蔓延\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The River Fever is abroad in Rotherhithe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:45.56,0:38:47.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}福尔摩斯 我们得立刻送你上医院\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Holmes, we must get you to a hospital at once.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:47.68,0:38:50.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不 和我保持距离\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, Now keep your distance!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:50.19,0:38:51.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你不知道这病是会传染的么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't you see this thing is contagious?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:52.07,0:38:54.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你觉得我会在意这个么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you think such a consideration weighs with me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:54.71,0:38:56.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}离我远点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Keep your distance!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:57.85,0:39:01.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这病可能会传遍整个伦敦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This could run through London.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:18.81,0:39:20.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是痉挛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's cramps.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:20.48,0:39:21.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}福尔摩斯？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Holmes?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:26.26,0:39:27.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}非要请医生的话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If I had a doctor at least{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:27.82,0:39:30.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}至少得请个让我信得过的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}let me have someone whom I have confidence?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.92,0:39:32.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你信不过我？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have none in me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:32.70,0:39:33.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你的友情 当然信得过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your friendship, yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.63,0:39:35.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}可你只是一名普通的执业医师\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But you're only a general practitioner{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:35.82,0:39:38.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}经验不足\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}with mediocre qualifications.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:38.51,0:39:40.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你的这评论可不足取 福尔摩斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That remark is unworthy of you, Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.98,0:39:43.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}它清楚地向我表明了 你神经焦躁不安的状态\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It shows me very clearly the state of your nerves.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:43.43,0:39:45.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}它证明了你的无知\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That demonstrates your ignorance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:45.45,0:39:47.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你对塔帕努里(印尼地名)热病 知道多少？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you know about Tapanuli Fever?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:47.63,0:39:49.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你知道福摩萨黑色败血症么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you know about Black Formosa corruption?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:50.00,0:39:51.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我从来没有听过这两种病\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have never heard of either.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:51.57,0:39:55.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这是东方奇怪的病症\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That is strange pathological disorders in the east.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:55.44,0:39:57.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}要是你信不过我 我去请贾斯帕 米克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you have no faith in me, let me fetch Jasper Meek.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:57.65,0:39:59.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}还有彭罗斯 费舍尔 另外埃斯特利也在伦敦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Penrose Fisher, Ainstree is here in London.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:59.53,0:40:00.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我去把他找来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let me fetch him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:01.58,0:40:04.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}只有一个人能帮助我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's only one man who can help me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:05.11,0:40:07.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}一个被我们中伤过的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a man we have maligned.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:08.38,0:40:10.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}卡尔弗顿 史密斯？你相信他会帮忙么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Culverton Smith? Do you believe he would help?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:10.65,0:40:12.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他必须帮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He must.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:13.88,0:40:15.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这是我唯一的机会了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It is my only chance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:19.11,0:40:20.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}牡蛎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oysters,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:23.46,0:40:25.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}它们真的会繁殖 不是么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}they do breed don't they?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:26.45,0:40:28.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我不能想象整个海底\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I cannot think that the whole bottom of the ocean{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:28.78,0:40:32.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}就是一团硬硬的牡蛎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}is one solid mass of oysters.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:34.04,0:40:37.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}福尔摩斯 你能听见我说话么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Holmes, can you hear me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:39.86,0:40:43.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我马上就出门去找卡尔弗顿 史密斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm going for Culverton Smith this instant.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:43.83,0:40:45.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那你去吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:46.09,0:40:48.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我会把他带回来的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm to bring him back here with me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:49.19,0:40:52.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他是研究洪水热的专家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's the emperor of river fevers,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:52.95,0:40:54.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你要说服他来这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}of course you must persuade him{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:54.76,0:40:57.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但你得找个借口先回来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but you must return alone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:58.27,0:41:02.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}随便什么借口 别跟他一起回来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Any excuse not to come with him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:02.14,0:41:06.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}跟他说我很抱歉 真的很抱歉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tell him I apologize, I do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:06.63,0:41:08.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}别让我失望 华生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't fail me Watson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:09.07,0:41:10.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}当然不会的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Of course not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:15.09,0:41:17.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那些河流里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And what of rivers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:19.23,0:41:20.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}没有天敌\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are there no natural enemies{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:20.95,0:41:24.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}来限制那些生物的繁殖么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to limit the increase of these creatures?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:26.54,0:41:28.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}可怕\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's horrible,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:29.50,0:41:31.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}太可怕了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}horrible.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:43.50,0:41:45.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我要见卡尔弗顿 史密斯 这事很重要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's essential that I see Mr. Culverton Smith.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:45.48,0:41:47.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}先生 卡尔弗顿 史密斯先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Culverton Smith, sir,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:47.08,0:41:48.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不希望在他工作时\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}does not appreciate being disturbed{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:48.51,0:41:49.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}有人打扰\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}during his hours of study.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:49.97,0:41:52.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 等一下 您不能… - 史密斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Just a minute sir, you can't just... - Smith!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:52.05,0:41:53.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sir!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:53.63,0:41:54.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}史密斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Smith!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:54.50,0:41:55.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}别这样 先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please sir!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:56.03,0:41:56.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}史密斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Smith!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:56.95,0:41:58.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}先生 您不能这样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sir, you can't just,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:58.85,0:42:00.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}您不能进去 先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you can't just walk in, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:07.66,0:42:09.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}噢 史密斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ah, Smith.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:09.33,0:42:11.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}您这么做是要干什么 先生？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the devil do you mean by this, sir?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:11.74,0:42:14.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我是为了歇洛克 福尔摩斯来的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've come from Sherlock Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:14.49,0:42:16.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他病的很重\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He is desperately ill,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:16.51,0:42:17.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他请求您去看看他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and he begs you to come to him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:18.07,0:42:19.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}为什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:19.25,0:42:21.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}您就是个医生 可以照顾他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You are a physician, tend to him yourself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:21.75,0:42:24.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他相信你是唯一能救他的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He believes that you are the only man who can save him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:25.45,0:42:26.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}救他？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Save him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:27.12,0:42:28.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我求你来看看吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I beg you to come.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:29.35,0:42:31.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他感染了什么病了？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What has he contracted?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:31.20,0:42:33.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他想就是害死你表弟的那种热病\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He thinks it is the fever which killed your cousin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:34.05,0:42:35.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他怎么能染上那种病？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How did he come by it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:35.76,0:42:37.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他去过罗哲海斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He has been in Rotherhithe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:37.39,0:42:39.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}噢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ah,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:39.83,0:42:41.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}真令人遗憾\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry to hear this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:42.93,0:42:44.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我希望您弄错了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I hope you are wrong.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:45.12,0:42:47.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}尽管那天他侮辱了我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Despite his insulting behavior the other day,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:47.38,0:42:49.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我仍旧尊重他的才智\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have every respect for his talents.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:50.24,0:42:51.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他的业余爱好是研究犯罪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's an amateur of crime{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:51.98,0:42:53.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}就像我的业余爱好是研究疾病\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}as I am of disease.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:54.38,0:42:56.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}坏人之于他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For him the villain,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:56.41,0:42:58.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}仿佛细菌之于我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}for me the microbe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:59.99,0:43:02.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这里是我的囚徒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here are my prisoners.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:02.49,0:43:05.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}在这些培养基的明胶里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Among these gelatin cultivations,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:05.07,0:43:08.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}有世界上最凶恶的犯人在服刑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}some of the worst offenders in the world are doing time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:08.34,0:43:09.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}求你了 已经没有时间可以浪费了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please, please, there is no time to lose.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:10.01,0:43:11.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他都病得快死了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He is desperately ill.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:11.12,0:43:13.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这跟我有什么相干？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Of what consequence is that to me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:15.31,0:43:17.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他用最无礼的态度对我造谣中伤\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He maligned me in the most outrageous manner.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:17.28,0:43:20.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他为此感到后悔 他一直在重复这一点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He, he regrets it, he was most  insistent upon that point.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:20.06,0:43:23.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他知道热病在罗哲海斯流行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He knows that the fever was abroad in Rotherhithe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:26.22,0:43:27.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他病了有多久了？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How long has he been ill?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:27.49,0:43:28.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}三天了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Three days.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:29.20,0:43:30.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他有没有神智昏迷 胡言乱语？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is he delirious?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:30.52,0:43:32.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}有时候很严重\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sometimes seriously so.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:32.68,0:43:34.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我立刻随你一起去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I will come with you at once.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:34.60,0:43:36.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我另外还约了点事情 先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have another appointment, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:36.23,0:43:37.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那好 我就自己去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Very well, I shall go alone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:37.13,0:43:40.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}最多半个小时 我就会到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Staples, you can rely on my being there in a half an hour at most.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:43.72,0:43:44.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你见到他了么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did you see him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:44.83,0:43:45.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是的 他正在赶来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, he's coming.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:45.91,0:43:47.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你是最好的信使\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ah, you're the best of messengers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:47.76,0:43:50.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你可以离开这里了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can disappear from the scene now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:50.33,0:43:51.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我应该留下来听听他的意见 福尔摩斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I should stay to hear his opinion, Holmes,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:51.93,0:43:52.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}真的很有必要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I really should.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:52.72,0:43:54.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他敏感的近乎病态\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No reason he is morbidly sensitive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:54.79,0:43:56.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们必须让他独自展现他的技艺\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We must let him practice his arts alone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:56.39,0:43:58.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 亲爱的福尔摩斯 - 前门有动静\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- My dear, Holmes. - That's the front door,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:59.04,0:44:00.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:00.19,0:44:01.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}快藏起来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hide.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:01.08,0:44:02.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}藏起来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hide.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:02.10,0:44:03.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}快 如果你爱我的话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Quick, if you love me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:28.25,0:44:30.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}福尔摩斯？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Holmes?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:52.30,0:44:54.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}福尔摩斯？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Holmes?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:54.63,0:44:57.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}哦 史密斯 我不敢奢望你能来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, Smith, I hardly dared to hope.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:57.12,0:44:58.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我也想不到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I should imagine not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:59.13,0:45:01.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}看 我还是来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yet you see I'm here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:01.11,0:45:02.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}要以德报怨 福尔摩斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Coals of fire Holmes,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:02.75,0:45:04.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}以德报怨\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}coals of fire.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:04.14,0:45:05.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}真是高尚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's noble.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:05.92,0:45:07.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你知道你得了什么病么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you know what is wrong with you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:07.10,0:45:07.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:07.74,0:45:09.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你知道这些症状么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You recognize the symptoms?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:09.33,0:45:10.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是的 很清楚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, quite well.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:10.76,0:45:11.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那你是病了三天了？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Three days with you then?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:11.83,0:45:12.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:12.45,0:45:13.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你坚持的不错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have lasted well.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:13.60,0:45:15.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}到这天维克托就已经死了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}With Victor it was all over by now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:15.66,0:45:17.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我注意到了这点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have noticed this,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:17.37,0:45:20.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}越是成熟冷静 坚持的越久\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the more mature coolies seems to last longer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:20.78,0:45:22.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}请给我水 给我水喝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Water please. Could I have some water?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:22.60,0:45:24.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}哦 最后的口渴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, the final thirst.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:25.66,0:45:27.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你快要完了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're near the end.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:33.91,0:45:36.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}请帮帮我 尽你所能帮帮我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please help me, help me if you can.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:38.75,0:45:40.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我可以替你隐瞒你的动机\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I could champion your cause.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:41.05,0:45:42.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我的动机？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My cause?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:42.04,0:45:43.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你的工作\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your work.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:43.35,0:45:44.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}它应该广为宣传\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It deserves to be trumpeted.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:45.05,0:45:46.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我可以为你效劳\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I could be of service.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:46.89,0:45:48.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我很怀疑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I doubt it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:48.50,0:45:49.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}多亏了你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thanks to you{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:49.42,0:45:52.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}给我名誉带来了不可弥补的损害\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the damage done to my reputation is irreparable.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:52.76,0:45:55.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你是说维克托 萨维奇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You mean Victor Savage,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:55.98,0:45:56.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你的表弟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}your cousin,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:56.69,0:45:58.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我都已经忘了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I had forgotten that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:59.36,0:46:01.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你也被牵涉进来了么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did you, were you involved?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:01.73,0:46:03.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我有点不确定了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I couldn't be sure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:08.79,0:46:12.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}大侦探也有不清楚的时候\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The great detective couldn't be sure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:12.76,0:46:15.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}就算你知道萨维奇是怎么死的 也没有关系\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well it doesn't matter to me if you know how Savage died.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:15.34,0:46:17.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你是不会坐在证人席上了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't see you in the witness box,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:17.18,0:46:19.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}只可能是躺在另外一种盒子里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}quite another sort of box.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:24.98,0:46:27.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}就在他吸鸦片吸得不省人事的时候\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I put an infected mosquito to his neck{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:27.45,0:46:30.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我在他的脖子上放了一只受感染的蚊子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}while he was in an opiate stupor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:31.77,0:46:33.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}就是这样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:35.29,0:46:36.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但是你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But you,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:37.06,0:46:39.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你又是怎么被传染的？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}how did you come to contract it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:39.99,0:46:41.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你那个来找我的同伴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That fellow who came for me{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:41.46,0:46:44.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}告诉我说你是在罗哲海斯被传染的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}told me you thought you caught it in Rotherhithe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:44.44,0:46:46.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我只能这么认为\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, I can only account for it, so.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:47.02,0:46:48.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}好好回想一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cast your mind back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:49.04,0:46:51.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 痉挛？- 是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Cramps? - Oh, yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:51.51,0:46:53.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 帮帮我 - 我会的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Help me. - I will.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:54.51,0:46:55.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}疼痛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The pain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:55.76,0:46:58.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}死之前总是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, the coolies used to do some squealing{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:58.65,0:47:00.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}伴随着哀号\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}before the end.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:01.09,0:47:02.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}好吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:06.17,0:47:08.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}在几天前 你还没有发病的时候\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A few days before your symptoms began{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:08.54,0:47:11.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你是不是收到过什么邮件\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}did you receive anything by post?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:11.46,0:47:12.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我想不起来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't think.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:12.78,0:47:14.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}一个包裹？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A parcel?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:14.66,0:47:15.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你收到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You did.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:16.14,0:47:17.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是的 一些烟草的样品\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, samples of tobacco.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:17.89,0:47:19.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}没错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:19.23,0:47:22.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你没有注意那个盒子的结构么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did you notice the construction of the box?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:22.32,0:47:23.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}在烟草下面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Under the tobacco,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:23.65,0:47:26.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}有两根小钉子伸了出来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}two small tacks stuck out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:26.74,0:47:28.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你没有看到么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You didn't see them?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:32.32,0:47:34.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是它传染了热病么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They were infected?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:35.24,0:47:37.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你这傻瓜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You fool.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:37.75,0:47:40.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你找我的茬 现在你玩完了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You would tangle with me and now you are finished.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:44.15,0:47:45.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那个盒子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The box.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:47.74,0:47:49.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}现在在哪？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where is it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:52.30,0:47:53.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}在哪？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where is it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:58.60,0:48:00.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}把煤气灯拧亮点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Turn up the gas.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:00.83,0:48:02.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}把煤气灯拧亮点？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Turn up the gas?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:02.99,0:48:05.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}影子越来越长了 是么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The shadows begin to lengthen, do they?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:05.56,0:48:07.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}好的 我来拧亮点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, I'll do that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:12.42,0:48:15.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我更喜欢在亮一点的灯光下看着你死去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I prefer to see you die in the light.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:25.86,0:48:27.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}在这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There it is,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:28.79,0:48:31.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你最后的一小点证据\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}your last shred of evidence.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:32.13,0:48:33.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, well,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:34.08,0:48:36.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}还有什么可以效劳的么 我的朋友\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}is there any other little service I can do you my friend?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:36.78,0:48:41.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}火柴 香烟会很棒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A match and a cigarette would be most welcome.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:55.70,0:48:58.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}三天不吃不喝是一回事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Three days without food and water is one thing,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:59.84,0:49:03.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但是抽不上烟 就太痛苦了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but to be without tobacco I have found most irksome.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:03.60,0:49:05.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}探长 进来吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come in Inspector.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:08.72,0:49:10.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}以拧亮煤气灯为信号\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}By turning up the gas,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:11.02,0:49:15.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}史密斯亲自发出了我们的信号\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Smith was good enough to give our signal himself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:15.86,0:49:19.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他坦白谋杀了维克托 萨维奇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is the self-confessed murderer of Victor Savage.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:19.29,0:49:20.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你可以信口开河 福尔摩斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You may lie as you like Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:20.97,0:49:24.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但你证明不了你精神错乱的猜想\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have no corroboration for you insane suspicions.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:24.39,0:49:28.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}华生 他身后有一个盒子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Watson, he has a box behind his back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:29.26,0:49:31.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}小心点拿着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Treat it very gingerly{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:31.88,0:49:33.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}千万别打开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and don't open it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:33.96,0:49:35.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}去死吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Damn you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:35.22,0:49:37.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 阻止他 - 你去死吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Stop him. - Damn you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:01.78,0:50:04.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}扮演一个角色最成功的办法\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The best way of acting a part successfully{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:04.15,0:50:05.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}就是成为这个角色\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}is to be it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:05.59,0:50:06.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}要凡士林做什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's the vaseline for?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:06.86,0:50:08.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}涂抹在额头\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For the forehead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:09.02,0:50:10.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}眼睛里滴些颠茄酊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Belladonna in the eyes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:11.94,0:50:13.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}蜂蜡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bee's wax.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:13.00,0:50:16.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}抹在嘴唇周围\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Incrustation around the lips.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:16.90,0:50:19.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}为什么你不让我靠近你呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why wouldn't you let me near you,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:19.26,0:50:21.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}事实上你并没有被感染\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}when in truth there was no infection?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:21.83,0:50:24.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你以为我看不起你的医道么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you imagine that I have no respect for your medical talents?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:24.99,0:50:26.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}距离6英尺\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}At six feet{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:26.30,0:50:28.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我可以瞒过你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I could deceive you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:28.24,0:50:30.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但要是更近些\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But any closer,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:31.43,0:50:32.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你就会做出机敏的判断了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}with your astute judgment,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:32.51,0:50:33.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不 不 不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}no, no, no, no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:34.89,0:50:37.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}最重要的是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No it was essential,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:37.19,0:50:40.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你和哈德森太太要相信我快死了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that you and Mrs. Hudson believed me to be at death's door{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:40.45,0:50:43.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不然史密斯就像老鼠一样会有所察觉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}otherwise Smith would have smelt a rat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:43.87,0:50:44.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}老鼠\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rats,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:44.96,0:50:46.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}蜂蜡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}bee's wax,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:46.25,0:50:47.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}福尔摩斯先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Holmes,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:47.59,0:50:51.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你是全伦敦最糟糕的房客了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you are the very worst tenant in London.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:00.23,0:51:02.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}乔吉说他要来保卫庄园\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Georgie says he's going to guard the house.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:02.95,0:51:04.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他们都是好孩子 萨维奇夫人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh they're fine children, Mrs. Savage.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:04.64,0:51:06.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}就像是小天使\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're little angels.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:06.00,0:51:09.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这么多年来我们都是称为萨维奇家族\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For years we're known as little savages.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:14.77,0:51:16.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}谢谢你 华生医生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you, Dr. Watson,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:16.31,0:51:18.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}让我们回到家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}for letting us keep our home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:19.14,0:51:20.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}谢谢你 亲爱的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you my dear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:20.01,0:51:21.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我很想接受这份荣誉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'd like to take the credit{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:21.12,0:51:24.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但那属于福尔摩斯先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but it belongs to Mr. Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:37.24,0:51:40.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们很感激您 先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We are very grateful to you, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:43.20,0:51:45.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是我的荣幸 萨维奇小姐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My privilege, Miss. Savage.{\r}
